  "instruction": "For 2025, build a warehouse fulfillment SLA dashboard from fulfillments. Include only 'delivered' fulfillments shipped in the year with a non-null delivery timestamp. Return warehouse, delivered_fulfillments, and on_time_fulfillments, where on time means delivered_at is no later than promised_at. Order by warehouse. Exclude cancelled, unresolved, and out-of-year fulfillments (ineligible_rows, null_values, year_boundary).",
